*>   2009-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 947
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0037.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CRD0037C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 WS-DEC             PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2000-SCORE-DECISION
    DISPLAY "WS-DEC=" WS-DEC
    STOP RUN.
2000-SCORE-DECISION.
    *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
    IF TX-WS-CSCR >= 740
       AND TX-DR-RT < 0.40
        MOVE 'A' TO WS-DEC
    ELSE
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        IF TX-WS-CSCR >= 640
            MOVE 'R' TO WS-DEC
        ELSE
            MOVE 'D' TO WS-DEC
        END-IF
    END-IF.
